    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Verŭlae</span></b> , ārum,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of</i> Latium, now <i>Veroli</i>, <i><span class="en">Flor. 1,
				11, 6</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Verŭ-lānus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of Verulœ</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 9,
			42</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9,
				43</span></i>.—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Verŭlāni</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Verulœ</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				9, § 64</span></i>.</div>
